    println("========================================")
    println("Why FLOW is the easiest:")
    println("========================================")
    println("")
    println("✓ No server setup (looking at you, SuperCollider)")
    println("✓ No UGen plumbing (ChucK)")
    println("✓ Compiled, not interpreted (10x faster than Sonic Pi)")
    println("✓ Real code, not patching (Max/MSP, Pure Data)")
    println("✓ Type-safe (catches bugs at compile time)")
    println("✓ One-liner instruments and patterns")
    println("✓ Musical concepts built-in (scales, chords, BPM)")
    println("✓ Ready-to-use synth presets")
    println("✓ Effects in one function call")
    println("")
    println("Just write music. That's it.")

    return 0
}
